{"id": "EUVD-2026-97000", "enisaUuid": "8f866ee3-bd0a-3919-b6ac-3615462b9a54", "description": "thClaws through 0.141.0 contains a link-following vulnerability in the post_inputs handler of the v1 API POST /v1/inputs endpoint that allows writes outside the workspace by following symlinks. Attackers who plant a symlink under the allowed inputs/ prefix can cause later authenticated uploads to write or truncate files outside the workspace with daemon privileges.", "datePublished": "2026-10-11T13:26:00", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-18T11:53:05", "baseScore": 2.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:P/PR:N/UI:P/VC:N/VI:L/VA:L/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@1ExmmukzRMWN7B4gQ4W-4Q/thclaws-api-inputs-symlink-escape", "https://github.com/thClaws/thClaws/blob/v0.141.0/crates/core/src/api_v1/artifacts.rs#L335-L420", "https://github.com/thClaws/thClaws", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/thclaws-through-0.141.0-symlink-following-file-write-via-post-v1-inputs"], "aliases": ["GHSA-8c39-3r7m-gwc4", "CVE-2026-108839"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.25, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "4f826ecc-c56a-3905-b93a-2446d9c38d1b", "product": {"name": "thClaws", "vendor": {"name": "thClaws"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22640.141.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "88da41c8-c81f-3b61-8a78-f6f9d76aac7d", "vendor": {"name": "thClaws"}}], "isExploited": false}